/* 首页 · 参照风格样板（v3）：雾蓝灰底 + 大圆角（卡 40rpx）+ 柔散阴影 + 宇宙卡环形进度与白色胶囊按钮。
   滑动防闪烁在 index.js 侧用渲染签名守卫解决，这里只管样式。 */
page{background:#eef1f8}
.avatar-img{overflow:hidden}

/* 今日目标条 */
.goal-card{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20rpx;background:#fff;border-radius:36rpx;box-shadow:0 12rpx 36rpx rgba(40,45,90,.055);padding:24rpx 28rpx;margin:24rpx 0}
.goal-ic{width:76rpx;height:76rpx;border-radius:50%;background:#e8f7ee;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:38rpx;flex-shrink:0}
.goal-main{flex:1;min-width:0}
.goal-l{font-size:22rpx;color:var(--muted)}
.goal-v{font-size:31rpx;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-top:4rpx}
.goal-streak{font-size:23rpx;font-weight:700;color:#c78310;background:#fff3de;border-radius:999rpx;padding:8rpx 20rpx;flex-shrink:0}

/* 宇宙探索入口（已降为紧凑行：主角是打卡，等级只做状态展示） */
.ucard{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18rpx;background:#fff;border-radius:36rpx;box-shadow:0 12rpx 36rpx rgba(40,45,90,.055);padding:22rpx 26rpx;margin-top:22rpx}
.uimg{width:84rpx;height:84rpx;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0}
.umain{flex:1;min-width:0}
.ut1{font-size:28rpx;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}
.utitle{font-size:21rpx;font-weight:500;color:var(--muted);margin-left:12rpx}
.ut2{font-size:22rpx;color:var(--muted);margin-top:5rpx}
.uarr{font-size:34rpx;color:#c3c9d8;flex-shrink:0}

/* 区块标题行 */
.sec-row{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;margin:2rpx 0 20rpx}
.sec-t2{font-size:34rpx;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}

/* 科目横滑卡 */
.cards{height:460rpx}
/* 每科固定专属渐变（行内 style 按科目给），所有卡同构、白字白胶囊按钮；切换时样式不变，无变色闪烁 */
.mcard{border-radius:40rpx;margin:6rpx 10rpx 14rpx;padding:28rpx 30rpx;height:calc(100% - 20rpx);box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column;box-shadow:0 16rpx 40rpx rgba(84,102,220,.24)}
.mc-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18rpx}
.mc-ic{width:76rpx;height:76rpx;border-radius:22rpx;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:38rpx;flex-shrink:0}
.mc-name{font-size:33rpx;font-weight:800;color:#fff;flex:1}
.mc-done{font-size:23rpx;color:#fff;background:rgba(255,255,255,.22);font-weight:700;border-radius:999rpx;padding:6rpx 18rpx}
.mc-btn{margin-top:auto;width:76%;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;height:84rpx;line-height:84rpx;border:none;border-radius:999rpx;background:#fff;color:#2c3160;font-size:30rpx;font-weight:700;padding:0;box-shadow:0 10rpx 24rpx rgba(10,10,40,.25);text-align:center}
.mc-btn[disabled]{background:rgba(255,255,255,.35);color:rgba(255,255,255,.9);box-shadow:none}
.mc-btn.ghost{background:rgba(255,255,255,.18);color:#fff;box-shadow:none}
/* 主角卡内部：副标题一行 + 中央大环（今日进度）+ 进度小字。环为纯 CSS conic 渐变（弃用 canvas，真机零风险） */
.mc-sub{margin-top:12rpx;font-size:24rpx;color:rgba(255,255,255,.85)}
.mc-ringwrap{position:relative;width:132rpx;height:132rpx;margin:16rpx auto 0}
.mc-ring{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:132rpx;height:132rpx;border-radius:50%}
.mc-ringhole{position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:104rpx;height:104rpx;border-radius:50%}
.mc-ringic{position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:80rpx;height:80rpx;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.30);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:42rpx}
.mc-pct{text-align:center;font-size:23rpx;color:rgba(255,255,255,.85);margin-top:8rpx}

/* 圆点 + 微型状态行 */
.dots{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:10rpx;margin-top:16rpx}
.dot{width:12rpx;height:12rpx;border-radius:999rpx;background:#d8dae6;color:#fff;font-size:14rpx;line-height:20rpx;text-align:center}
.dot.on{width:30rpx;background:var(--brand)}
.dot.done{width:20rpx;height:20rpx;background:#22c7a9}
.dot.done.on{width:30rpx}
.mini-row{text-align:center;margin-top:14rpx;font-size:24rpx}
.mini{color:var(--muted)}
.mini.on{color:var(--ink);font-weight:700}

/* 数据三小卡（横排：左图标圆盘 + 右侧标签/数字两行，三卡同基线） */
.stats-row{display:flex;gap:20rpx;margin-top:28rpx}
.smini{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14rpx;background:#fff;border-radius:36rpx;box-shadow:0 12rpx 36rpx rgba(40,45,90,.055);padding:24rpx 20rpx;min-width:0}
.sm-ic{width:64rpx;height:64rpx;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:32rpx;flex-shrink:0}
.sm-tx{flex:1;min-width:0}
.sm-l{display:block;font-size:21rpx;color:var(--muted);white-space:nowrap}
.sm-v{display:block;font-size:36rpx;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-top:3rpx}
.sm-u{font-size:21rpx;font-weight:600;color:var(--muted);margin-left:3rpx}

/* 排行榜入口卡 */
.rank-entry{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20rpx;background:#fff;border-radius:36rpx;box-shadow:0 12rpx 36rpx rgba(40,45,90,.055);padding:24rpx 28rpx;margin-top:22rpx}
.re-ic{width:72rpx;height:72rpx;border-radius:22rpx;background:#fff3de;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:36rpx;flex-shrink:0}
.re-main{flex:1;min-width:0}
.re-t{font-size:29rpx;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}
.re-s{font-size:23rpx;color:var(--muted);margin-top:4rpx}
.arr{color:var(--muted);font-size:34rpx}

/* 排行榜弹层 */
.mask{position:fixed;left:0;right:0;top:0;bottom:0;background:rgba(20,22,40,.45);z-index:50;display:flex;align-items:flex-end}
.sheet{background:#fff;width:100%;border-radius:24rpx 24rpx 0 0;padding:32rpx 30rpx 20rpx;box-sizing:border-box}
.sheet-t{font-size:32rpx;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}
.sheet-sub{font-size:23rpx;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6rpx}
.sheet-list{max-height:560rpx;margin-top:20rpx}
.rrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14rpx;height:84rpx;border-bottom:2rpx solid var(--line)}
.rrow:last-child{border-bottom:none}
.rrow.me{font-weight:700}
.rno{width:52rpx;text-align:center;font-size:27rpx;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);flex-shrink:0}
.rav{width:48rpx;height:48rpx;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0}
.rav-t{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:28rpx;background:var(--soft)}
.rname{flex:1;min-width:0;font-size:26rpx;color:var(--ink);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.me-tag{font-size:19rpx;background:var(--brand);color:#fff;border-radius:999rpx;padding:2rpx 12rpx;margin-left:10rpx}
.rstreak{font-size:22rpx;color:var(--muted);flex-shrink:0}
.renergy{font-size:26rpx;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);flex-shrink:0;min-width:96rpx;text-align:right}
.rempty{font-size:24rpx;color:var(--muted);padding:26rpx 0;text-align:center}
.sheet-close{text-align:center;font-size:28rpx;color:var(--brand);padding:22rpx 0 8rpx}

/* 扁平图标（images/icons/*.png，替代 emoji） */
.ic-img{width:38rpx;height:38rpx}
.ic-img-lg{width:42rpx;height:42rpx}

/* 打卡正确率曲线卡（鹰状星云行之前） */
.acc-card{background:#fff;border-radius:36rpx;padding:26rpx 26rpx 18rpx;margin:20rpx 0;box-shadow:0 12rpx 36rpx rgba(40,45,90,.055)}
.acc-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:8rpx}
.acc-t{font-size:29rpx;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}
.acc-legend{display:flex;gap:22rpx}
.lg{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8rpx;font-size:21rpx;color:var(--muted)}
.lg-line{width:26rpx;height:0;border-top:5rpx solid #5b6cf6;border-radius:3rpx}
.lg-line.prev{border-top:4rpx dashed #c3c9dd}
.acc-chart{display:block}
.acc-empty{font-size:24rpx;color:var(--muted);text-align:center;padding:44rpx 0 36rpx}
.acc-note{font-size:21rpx;color:#a0a6bd;text-align:center;padding-bottom:8rpx}
